---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Offsite Prefabrication" description="Conduit assemblies built and QA-checked in our yard, then set in a single pick." path="/prefab/">
<section class="dark" id="prefab"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <p class="label">Offsite prefabrication</p>
    <h1>Built in the shop. Installed in hours.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Conduit assemblies are engineered from the drawings, built and checked in our yard, then delivered to site ready to set. On the Long Beach Supercharger, every conduit for the main switchboard and all 8 power cabinets went in as one rack, in one pick.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="prefab-photos three">
    <figure><img src="/hemet.jpg" alt="Prefabricated conduit risers on strut racks at sunset" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Riser racks, Hemet</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src="/lift.jpg" alt="Prefabricated conduit rack lifted by telehandler on site" loading="lazy"><figcaption>One pick, Long Beach</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src="/hole.jpg" alt="Prefabricated conduit rack set in the excavation" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Set and ready for backfill</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step"><i>STEP 1</i><h3>Engineering and layout</h3><p>Assemblies laid out from the plan set: spacing, bends and stub-up locations for every piece of gear.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><i>STEP 2</i><h3>Shop fabrication</h3><p>Racks built on level ground by our crews, not in a trench.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><i>STEP 3</i><h3>QA/QC inspection</h3><p>Every assembly checked against the drawings and stamped before it leaves the yard.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><i>STEP 4</i><h3>Delivery and install</h3><p>Set in place with our own equipment, then backfilled.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="gains">
    <div class="gain"><b>5–10 days</b><span>Saved on the critical path</span></div>
    <div class="gain"><b>15–25%</b><span>Fewer conduit labor hours</span></div>
    <div class="gain"><b>30–50%</b><span>Shorter open-trench exposure</span></div>
    <div class="gain"><b>3–4×</b><span>More sites per month at volume</span></div>
  </div>
  <p class="note">Based on internal tracking across recent EV programs.</p>
</div></section>

<div class="ctaband"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Have a plan set? We'll price it.</h2>
  <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a bid</a>
</div></div>
</Base>
